                <pb facs="0351" n="341" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv10/pg341"/>

                <head>Appendix 179</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Sub-Committee on
                        Germany</hi> [<hi rendition="#italic">Regarding</hi>] <hi
                        rendition="#italic">German Exports</hi></p>
                <p>The attached letter No. W. 41/92, from the German Economic Commission at
                        Versailles,<anchor n="5" xml:id="d20-f1"/> on the subject of the
                    interpretation of the clauses contained in Note C. I. P. A. 766–G, dealing with
                    German export, is submitted to the Supreme Economic Council for information.</p>
                <p>The Sub-Committee on Germany is of opinion that the attached letter requires no
                    answer.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">(<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-05-27">27 <hi rendition="#small-caps">May</hi>,
                        1919</date>.)</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
